      "summary": "Sounds like a morning radio bulletin: short headlines, plain verbs and no panic. Stories are local, specific and told in the order they matter.",
      "dos": [
        "Write headlines in 12 words or fewer, present tense",
        "Name the town and the thing",
        "Mark updates with a quiet count"
